+/-- HOL `p2e_discrete` (pack3.hl:49):
+```
+p2e_discrete S <=> ?e. &0 < e /\ (!x y. x IN S /\ y IN S /\ dist(x, y) < e ==> x = y)
+```
+-/
+private def p2e_discrete (S : Set V3) : Prop :=
+  ∃ e : ℝ, 0 < e ∧ ∀ x y : V3, x ∈ S → y ∈ S → dist x y < e → x = y
+
+
+/-! ## Discreteness (pack3.hl:464-541) -/
