+  · rintro (rfl | rfl | rfl)
+    · exact p2e_p14_getD_symm_mem p u0 u1 u2 u3 hfix (by norm_num)
+    · exact p2e_p14_getD_symm_mem p u0 u1 u2 u3 hfix (by norm_num)
